Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.90,1:50:42.57,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(520,35)}Happiness is just a word to me...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.90,1:50:46.37,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.57,1:50:44.74,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(950,110)}...And it might've meant a thing or two...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.74,1:50:46.37,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1530,35)}...If I had known the difference.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.58,1:50:51.67,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(460,35)}Emptiness, a lonely parody...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.58,1:50:56.00,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.46,1:50:53.71,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(940,110)}...And my life, another smokin' gun...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.58,1:50:56.00,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1530,35)}...A sign of my indifference.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.05,1:51:00.22,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(400,35)}Always keepin' safe inside...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.05,1:51:04.35,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.26,1:51:02.68,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(920,110)}...Where no one ever had a chance...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.72,1:51:04.35,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1540,35)}...To penetrate and break in.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.72,1:51:09.18,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(455,35)}Let me tell you some have tried...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.72,1:51:14.27,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.22,1:51:11.27,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(950,110)}...But I would slam the door so tight...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.48,1:51:14.27,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1490,35)}...That they could never get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.40,1:51:21.07,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(520,35)}Kept my cool under lock and key...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.40,1:51:25.45,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.36,1:51:22.74,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1000,110)}...And I never shed a tear...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.99,1:51:25.45,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1460,35)}...Another sign of my condition.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.41,1:51:30.12,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(450,35)}Fear of love, or bitter vanity...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.41,1:51:34.21,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.25,1:51:31.79,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(710,110)}...That kept me on the run...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.83,1:51:34.21,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1370,35)}...The main events of my confession.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.63,1:51:38.84,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(415,35)}I kept a chain upon my door...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.63,1:51:43.22,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.00,1:51:41.13,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(850,110)}...That would shake the shame of Cain...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.26,1:51:43.22,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1565,35)}...Into a blind submission.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.55,1:51:47.72,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(490,35)}The burning ghost without a name...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.55,1:51:52.56,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.01,1:51:50.14,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1080,110)}...Was still callin' all the same...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.31,1:51:52.56,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1570,35)}...But I just wouldn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.02,1:51:58.52,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(290,45)}The longer I'd stall...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.02,1:52:06.70,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.69,1:51:59.94,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(405,125)}...The further I'd crawl...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.15,1:52:01.40,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(975,125)}The further I'd crawl...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.44,1:52:02.90,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1330,35)}...The harder I'd fall...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.86,1:52:06.70,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1535,125)}...I was crawlin' into the fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.66,1:52:09.99,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(310,35)}The more that I saw...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.66,1:52:18.17,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.16,1:52:11.45,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(370,125)}...The further I'd fall...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.62,1:52:12.91,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(885,125)}The further I'd fall...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.91,1:52:14.25,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1330,35)}The lower I'd crawl...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.29,1:52:18.17,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1535,125)}...I kept fallin' into the fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.64,1:52:29.14,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(230,50)}Into the fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.64,1:52:29.14,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.73,1:52:40.23,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1700,50)}Into the fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.73,1:52:40.23,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.36,1:52:48.12,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(390,30)}Suddenly it occurred to me...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.36,1:52:52.41,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.20,1:52:50.24,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(865,110)}...The reason for the run and hide...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.28,1:52:52.41,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1500,30)}...Had totaled my existence.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.08,1:52:56.71,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(450,30)}Everything left on the other side...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.08,1:53:00.55,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.75,1:52:58.92,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(975,115)}...Could never be much worse than this...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.83,1:53:00.55,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1495,30)}...But could I go the distance?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.80,1:53:05.09,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(480,30)}I faced the door and all my shame...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.80,1:53:09.93,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.34,1:53:07.43,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1030,115)}...Tearin' off each piece of chain...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.47,1:53:09.93,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1530,30)}...Until they were broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.47,1:53:13.85,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(420,30)}But no matter how I tried...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.47,1:53:18.35,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.93,1:53:15.94,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(930,110)}...The other side was locked so tight...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.98,1:53:18.35,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1485,30)}...The door it wouldn't open.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.19,1:53:24.11,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(325,30)}Gave it all that I got...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.19,1:53:31.87,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.23,1:53:25.70,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(445,110)}...And started to knock...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.65,1:53:26.99,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(840,30)}...Shouted for someone...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.90,1:53:28.45,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1180,110)}...To open the lock...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.28,1:53:31.87,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1450,30)}...I just gotta get through the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.70,1:53:35.33,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(420,30)}And the more that I knocked...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.70,1:53:42.84,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.41,1:53:36.62,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(385,110)}...The hotter I got...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.83,1:53:37.96,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(845,110)}The hotter I got...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.00,1:53:39.29,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1170,30)}...The harder I knocked...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.29,1:53:42.84,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1445,110)}...I just gotta break through the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.84,1:53:49.72,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(420,30)}Gotta knock a little harder...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.84,1:53:55.22,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.80,1:53:51.47,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1100,110)}...Gotta knock a little harder...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.64,1:53:52.85,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1485,30)}...Gotta knock a little harder...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.51,1:53:53.89,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(350,60)}...Break through the door...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.93,1:53:55.22,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,500)\pos(1300,50)}...Break through the door...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.74,1:54:56.54,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,2000)}Break down the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.74,1:54:56.54,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,2000)}
