Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:48.33,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fs64\pos(590,45)}You can't pray enough, you can't hide
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:48.33,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\pos(590,995)}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.33,0:05:52.71,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\pos(610,350)}You can be cool or you can cry
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.33,0:05:52.71,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\pos(590,990)}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.71,0:05:56.04,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1070,40)}Do it wrong, not at all, or do it right
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.71,0:05:56.04,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1070,790)}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.59,0:06:03.72,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\pos(585,55)}No one owes you, no one's to blame
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.59,0:06:03.72,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\pos(585,905)\fs64}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.72,0:06:08.89,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1375,135)}Save for bad genes or DNA
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.72,0:06:08.89,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1375,990)}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.89,0:06:13.39,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\pos(710,40)}Ask your conscience the why and how
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.89,0:06:13.39,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\pos(710,995)}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.39,0:06:16.69,ED Eng,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1240,45)}Do it then, do it when, but do it now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.39,0:06:16.69,ED Vie,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1240,995)}
